{"id":14260,"artist":"Reinhardt Django","title":"After You'Ve Gone","lyrics_plain":"Blindside\nabout a burning fire\nAfter you're gone\nI could not lie\nSkin untouched growing thicker for every step unwalked\nAnd I don't know if it's the cold intention-slide\nTaking me down\n\nBut what if You'd sing me alive\nI'm ready to give up the fight\nCause I'm just a stone\nRight after You're gone\n\nI could not lie\nEven though dead skin like stone makes me ugly\nIt still pounds inside and it's red\nAnd it's slipping through the grey cracks\nAnd I know You know\n\nBut what if You'd sing me alive\nI'm ready to give up the fight\nCause I'm just a stone\nRight after You're gone\n\nThe first thing that meets the eye\nWhen I crossover into the light\nI want it to be You\nRight after I'm gone","lyrics_synced":"[00:14.40] After You've Gone\n[00:17.20] and left me crying\n[00:19.20] After You've Gone\n[00:22.00] there's no denying\n[00:24.00] You'll feel blue\n[00:26.40] You'll feel sad\n[00:29.20] You'll miss the greatest\n[00:30.60] love you ever had\n[00:33.60] There'll come a time\n[00:36.40] now don't forget it\n[00:38.40] There'll come a time\n[00:41.20] when you'll regret it\n[00:43.20] Someday, when you grow lonely\n[00:48.40] your heart will break like mine\n[00:50.20] and you'll want me only\n[00:52.80] After You've Gone,\n[00:55.20] After You've Gone away\n[01:50.40] After You've Gone\n[01:53.20] and left me crying\n[01:55.20] After You've Gone\n[01:58.00] there's no denying\n[02:00.00] You'll feel blue\n[02:02.40] You'll feel sad\n[02:05.20] You'll miss the greatest\n[02:06.60] love you ever had\n[02:09.60] There'll come a time\n[02:12.41] now don't forget it\n[02:14.41] There'll come a time\n[02:17.21] when you'll regret it\n[02:19.20] Some day, when you grow lonely\n[02:24.41] your heart will break like mine\n[02:26.21] and you'll want me only\n[02:28.80] After You've Gone\n[02:31.20] After You've Gone away\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:14.39] <00:14.39>Af <00:14.80